meta {
  name: Tenancy
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  Restaurants can't reach each other's dishes. These requests use a dish of
  {{restaurant}} (firstDishId, set by List dishes) through
  {{otherRestaurant}}'s URL. Each gets the same 404 as a dish that doesn't
  exist, so they reveal nothing about it, and the dish is unchanged.
}
